.TH CRS\-NODES 1 "2026-11-20" "Mu2e DAQ" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
crs\-nodes \- log in to a Mu2e DAQ machine from a remote control room
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B remote\-site/crs\-nodes
.B \-\-site
.I NAME
.SH DESCRIPTION
Gets a Kerberos ticket if there is none (site keytab), then runs
.B ssh\-selector
from mu2edaq\-cluster\-tools on its Mu2e DAQ host list.
Choose the account the site identity is authorized as (the overlay's
.BR personal_user ).
.B remote\-site/install.sh
installs
.B ssh\-selector
when
.B ../mu2edaq\-cluster\-tools
is checked out next to controlroom\-setup.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.BR CRS_REMOTE_SITE ,
.BR DRY_RUN ,
.B CRS_NO_PAUSE
as for
.BR crs\-screen (1).
The site file may set SITE_SSH_SELECTOR and SITE_DAQ_HOSTS.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR crs\-screen (1),
.BR ssh\-selector (1)
